{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星孟子義近期屢遭私生飯跟蹤騷擾，今日（8號）上午行動更再次升級，令她不勝其煩，事後其工作室發表嚴正聲明，表示藝人今日出行時遭遇尾隨跟車、拍打車門及貼窗閃光拍攝，深感威脅到人身安全，工作室已第一時間向執法部門求助。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.600880+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T13:01:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"a39ae0adb324e58d301cbb31eba9d0fb9df1b8e32e5529a74acdecbc1d12ea00","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}